<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OK'S ERGO INVEST RIGHTS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OK'S ERGO INVEST RIGHTS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens bourse approved the 7.4 billion drachma rights issue by closed-end fund Ergo Invest.</p>
<p>The fund will issue 16,380,830 new common bearer shares at 450 drachmas. The terms will be one new share per one outstanding.</p>
<p>A total of 238,340 shares will also be privately placed to Ergo Invest's personnel and management at the issue price of 450 drachmas.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
